{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"detailModelConfigured"}],"externalID":"c:objc(cs)SCSectionActions(py)detailModelConfigured","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"STV"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"detailModelConfigured","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"property","title":"detailModelConfigured"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Action gets called after the section’s detail model is fully configured, including the addition of all automatically generated sections.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCSectionActions"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/stv\/scsectionactions\/detailmodelconfigured"]}],"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"nonatomic"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"copy","kind":"keyword"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:SCSectionActions.h@T@SCDetailModelSectionAction_Block","text":"SCDetailModelSectionAction_Block","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCDetailModelSectionAction_Block"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"detailModelConfigured","kind":"identifier"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This action is typically used to add additional custom sections, or modify the already existing automatically generated ones.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Example:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ Objective-C","sectionActions.detailModelConfigured = ^(SCTableViewSection *section, SCTableViewModel *detailModel, NSIndexPath *indexPath)","{","    SCTableViewSection *customSection = [SCTableViewSection section];","    SCCustomCell *customCell = [SCCustomCell cellWithText:@\"Custom Cell\"];","    [customSection addCell:customCell];","","    [detailModel addSection:customSection];","};"],"syntax":"objective-c","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In general, it is easier (and more recommended) to add your custom sections and cells using the data definitions, instead of using this action to do so. For more information, please refer to SCDataDefinition and SCCustomPropertyDefinition."}]}],"name":"Note","style":"note"},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This action is only applicable to sections that generate detail views, such as SCArrayOfObjectsSection.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Note","style":"note"},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the case where the detail model is not associated with an existing row (such as the case when "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SCArrayOfObjectsSection"},{"type":"text","text":" creates a new item), indexPath.row will be set to NSNotFound. This is a good way to test if the detail model was generated for a new item or an already existing one."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"Warning","style":"warning"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCSectionActions\/detailModelConfigured","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"references":{"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCSectionActions":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"SCSectionActions","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCSectionActions","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This class hosts a set of section action blocks. Once an action is set to a desired code block, it will execute the block as soon as the action occurs."}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scsectionactions","title":"SCSectionActions"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Build data-driven UIKit table interfaces with Sensible TableView."}],"title":"STV","url":"\/documentation\/stv","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV","kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCDetailModelSectionAction_Block":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"SCDetailModelSectionAction_Block","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"SCDetailModelSectionAction_Block","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scdetailmodelsectionaction_block","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCDetailModelSectionAction_Block","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A block invoked with a table-view section and its detail model."}]},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCSectionActions/detailModelConfigured":{"fragments":[{"text":"detailModelConfigured","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCSectionActions\/detailModelConfigured","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scsectionactions\/detailmodelconfigured","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Action gets called after the section’s detail model is fully configured, including the addition of all automatically generated sections.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"detailModelConfigured"}}}